        "@value": "Identifier scheme of the internal identifier assigned by the GoTriple platform to a resource. Declared in the TRIPLE namespace because datacite:local-resource-identifier-scheme cannot distinguish an identifier local to GoTriple from one local to the source system. On profiles it carries the Elasticsearch id."
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "TRIPLE Internal ID"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "https://schema.org/creativeWorkStatus",
    "@type": [
      "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The status of a creative work in terms of its stage in a lifecycle."
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label": [
      {
        "@value": "schema:creativeWorkStatus"
      },
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "schema:creativeWorkStatus"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "https://schema.org/ContactPoint",
    "@type": [
      "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "A contact point for a person or organization."
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label": [
      {
        "@value": "schema:ContactPoint"
      },
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "schema:ContactPoint"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "https://schema.org/contributor",
    "@type": [
      "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "A secondary contributor to the CreativeWork or Event."
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "schema:contributor"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "https://schema.org/inLanguage",
    "@type": [
      "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The language of the content or performance or used in an action."
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "schema:inLanguage"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "https://gotriple.eu/ontology/triple/ContentType",
    "@type": [
      "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The kind of content a resource is (journal article, dataset, software, ...), drawn from the Content Type controlled vocabulary and aligned with COAR resource types."
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Content Type"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf": [
      {
        "@id": "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "http://purl.org/spar/datacite/doi",
    "@type": [
      "http://purl.org/spar/datacite/IdentifierScheme",
      "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Digital Object Identifier - a persistent identifier for digital objects, standardised as ISO 26324 and governed by the International DOI Foundation."
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "datacite:doi"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "https://schema.org/about",
    "@type": [
      "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The subject matter of the content. In GoTriple it carries the concepts of the TRIPLE Vocabulary (SSH-LCSH) detected in the resource by the enrichment pipeline: the values are the concepts themselves, identified by their semantics.gr URI, not local copies of them."
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "schema:about"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "https://gotriple.eu/ontology/triple/hasLicense",
    "@type": [
      "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Links a resource to its licence."
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "has license"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range": [
      {
        "@id": "https://gotriple.eu/ontology/triple/License"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subPropertyOf": [
      {
        "@id": "http://purl.org/dc/terms/license"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "https://schema.org/CreativeWork",
    "@type": [
      "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "schema:CreativeWork"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "https://gotriple.eu/ontology/triple/original_id_schema",
    "@type": [
      "http://purl.org/spar/datacite/IdentifierScheme",
      "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Identifier scheme of the identifier a resource carried in the system it was harvested from, i.e. local to the source system rather than to GoTriple; used when that system has no named scheme of its own. For projects it carries the code assigned by the funding programme (e.g. a Horizon 2020, PRIN or FWF grant number)."
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Original Identifier"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "https://schema.org/dateModified",
    "@type": [
      "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The date on which the CreativeWork was most recently modified or when the item's entry was modified within a DataFeed. In GoTriple it records the last update of the record in the index; on a profile, the last GoTriple update."
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label": [
      {
        "@value": "schema:dateModified"
      },
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "schema:dateModified"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/date",
    "@type": [
      "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "A point or period of time associated with an event in the lifecycle of the resource (Dublin Core Elements 1.1)."
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "dc:date"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "https://gotriple.eu/ontology/triple/originalLicense",
    "@type": [
      "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The license statement exactly as received from the source provider (e.g. 'CC BY 4.0', a URL, free text), before normalization to the License controlled vocabulary. The normalized value is expressed via triple:hasLicense."
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "original license"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range": [
      {
        "@id": "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subPropertyOf": [
      {
        "@id": "http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/rights"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "https://gotriple.eu/ontology/triple/AccessCondition",
    "@type": [
      "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The access condition of a resource — how and to whom it is available — drawn from the Access Condition controlled vocabulary and aligned with COAR access rights."
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Access Condition"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf": [
      {
        "@id": "http://purl.org/dc/terms/RightsStatement"
      },
      {
        "@id": "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "https://w3id.org/mod#SemanticArtefact",
    "@type": [
      "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "A machine-readable object that formalises a shared conceptualisation: an ontology, a thesaurus, a taxonomy, a vocabulary (MOD, Metadata for Ontology Description and publication)."
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "mod:SemanticArtefact"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "https://schema.org/Language",
    "@type": [
      "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Natural language such as Spanish, Tamil, or English."
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "schema:Language"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "http://purl.org/spar/datacite/IdentifierScheme",
    "@type": [
      "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "A scheme that uniquely identifies entities of a particular type."
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "datacite:IdentifierScheme"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#representationTechnique",
    "@type": [
      "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "More information about the format in which the semantic artefact is released. This is different from the file format: for example, a ZIP file (file format) could contain an XML schema (representation technique)."
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "adms:representationTechnique"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range": [
      {
        "@id": "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "https://schema.org/Place",
    "@type": [
      "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Entities that have a somewhat fixed, physical extension."
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Place"
      },
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "schema:Place"
      }
    ]
  },
